cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SDOH-CKDPred: open CKD small-area surveillance and screening-triage pipeline"
version: 6.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
authors:
  - family-names: Sahu
    given-names: Ajit
    affiliation: DataSafeguard.ai
  - family-names: Mukherjee
    given-names: Sanjoy
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
repository-code: "https://github.com/ajitbubu/sdoh_ckd_pred"
abstract: >-
  Code for the JMIR Public Health and Surveillance submission: Stage 1 relates
  the Neighborhood Atlas Area Deprivation Index to CDC PLACES 2022 tract-level
  diagnosed CKD prevalence; Stage 2 identifies adults with single-visit
  laboratory markers of CKD in NHANES 2017-2023 without laboratory inputs.
  All results are regenerated from public data by the scripts in src/.
